    {
      "text": "A PRISMA flow diagram for the scoping review: 1054 studies imported for screening, 246 duplicates removed; 808 studies screened, 790 irrelevant; 18 full-text studies assessed for eligibility, 5 excluded for wrong outcomes; 0 studies ongoing and 0 awaiting classification; 13 studies included.",
